values ('a9b0c1d2-3e4f-4a77-8c67-7d8e9f0a1b47', 'page-layout-indesign', 'Page Layout (InDesign)', 'Page Layout (InDesign) develops the technical, visual, and production judgment required to design professional publications for print and digital delivery. Students learn InDesign through editorial design problems: grids, typography, multi-page systems, image placement, styles, parent pages, tables, preflight, packaging, accessible exports, and critique-driven revision. The course culminates in a polished publication system that can function as a portfolio case study.');

